        "Content": "FOR SALE BY PRIVATE TREATY\n215 OLDTOWN WOODS, CELBRIDGE, CO. KILDARE, W23 YRC0.\n\nTo organize a viewing or to place a bid on this property go to www.teamlorraine.ie or scan the QR code on the photograph section of this brochure.\n\n Circle of Legends` & Award-Winning International RE/MAX Agent for over 25 years, Team Lorraine Mulligan of RE/MAX Results is proud to present this exceptional 2 bed duplex A rated home, perfectly positioned in the sought-after and modern residential development of Oldtown Woods in Celbridge. Inside, this bright and spacious home offers well-proportioned and thoughtfully designed living accommodation. The ground floor offers under floor heating, on entering the home it features a wide entrance hallway with large storage area, a W.C, a generous open plan living/dining space, fully fitted kitchen with peninsula and granite work tops overlooking the private rear garden perfect for modern family life and entertaining. \n\nUpstairs, you`ll find two comfortable bedrooms, and a sleek, contemporary family bathroom, this home also enjoys a hidden gem of a utility space on the first floor allowing the discerning buyer the advantage of keeping all the laundry on one floor.\n\nThe rear garden is low-maintenance westerly orientation and private, offering an ideal outdoor sanctuary for summer barbecues, relaxation, or safe play for children. \n\nLocated in the heart of the popular Oldtown Woods development, 215 Oldtown Woods offers the perfect blend of stylish suburban living and everyday convenience. This beautifully maintained and move-in-ready home is ideal for first-time buyers, families, investors, or those looking to trade down within one of Celbridge`s most desirable neighbourhoods. With a strong sense of community and all local amenities just minutes away, this property presents a fantastic opportunity to enjoy a modern lifestyle in a well-connected and sought-after area.\n\nOldtown Woods is a relatively new and meticulously planned development, built to the highest energy standards and is known for its contemporary homes, no 215 is a large two bedroomed home and spans C.85sqm and is close to a large, landscaped green, and has a welcoming sense of community. Residents of this development enjoy close proximity to excellent primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, and the historic Celbridge Main Street, all just a short walk away. Scenic attractions such as Castletown House & Parklands and the River Liffey Walks are also within easy reach for outdoor enthusiasts.\n\nFor commuters, 215 Oldtown Woods is extremely well-connected. The Hazelhatch & Celbridge train station (serving Dublin City Centre and beyond) is just a short drive or cycle away. The area is also well served by regular Dublin Bus routes, and there is easy access to the M4, M7, and M50 motorways ensuring stress-free travel to Dublin and surrounding areas.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented and ideally located home in a modern, family-oriented development. Whether you`re starting out or downsizing, 215 Oldtown Woods has everything you need style, comfort, and convenience.\n\nTo organize a viewing or to place a bid on this property go to www.teamlorraine.ie or scan the QR code on the photograph section of this brochure.\n"
      },
