        "Content": "DOWNSTAIRS ACCOMMODATION\nHALLWAY:\nLight fitting, large storage unit, under floor heating, carpet on stairs. \n\nKITCHEN/ LIVING ROOM:8.2m x 3.43m\nSpotlights, light fitting, blinds, shaker style floor and wall cabinets with ample storage, granite work tops, integrated fridge, freezer, dishwasher, extractor fan, oven hob, wooden floors, sliding door leading to garden area.\n\nGUEST W C: Light fitting, extractor fan, WC, wash hand basin, mirror, under the stair storage, LVT covering under floor heating.\n\n\nUPSTAIRS ACCOMMODATION\nLANDING:\nLight fitting, carpet, hot press with shelving, ample storage.\n\nUTILITY SPACE:\nLight filling, area fully plumbed, washing machine/ dryer.\n\nBEDROOM ONE: 4.87m x 2.77m\nLight fitting, blinds, curtains, fitted wardrobes, wooden floor.\n\nBEDROOM TWO: 2.53m x 2.84m\nLight fitting, blinds, fitted wardrobes, wooden floor.\n\nMAIN BATHROOM: 1.75m x 2.60m\nLight fitting, extractor fan, shaving light and socket, over sink mirror, wash hand basin with vanity, WC, main bath with shower, heated towel rail, glass shower door, wall and floor tiles.\n\nFEATURES INTERNAL:\nOwn front door\nGround floor - Underfloor heating\nLots of storage\nTwo double bedrooms\nGuest wc\nHeating very economical\nAll white goods included \nLight fittings included\nAll blinds and curtains included\n\nFEATURES EXTERNAL:\nLow-maintenance garden\nRaised flower beds to the front\nPatio area\nCobblelock patio area\nSide entrance\nDouble-glazed PVC windows\nPVC front door\nPVC fascia and soffit\nOutdoor socket \nOutdoor lights\nDesignated parking spot, plenty of visitor parking\n\nSQUARE FOOTAGE: 85.8sqm / 923.54sqft\n\nHOW OLD IS THE PROPERTY: Built in C. 2022\n\nMANAGEMENT FEE: 1500 approx pa\n\nBACK GARDEN ORIENTATION: West Facing\n\nBER RATING: A2 - 43.07 kWh/m²/yr\n\nBER NUMBER: 114349921\n\nEMISSIONS INDICATOR: 5.51 kgCO2 /m²/yr\n\nSERVICES: Mains water, Mains sewage\n\nHEATING SYSTEM: Air to water \n\nHOUSE STATUS: Owner-occupied \n\n\nDISCLAIMER\nNotice to all parties viewing this brochure\n1.This brochure is provided for general guidance only. Nothing in it forms or constitutes an offer, contract, or binding agreement, and none of its contents should be treated as a statement of fact upon which any party can rely.\n2.Neither the Agent nor any member of staff has the authority to make representations or give warranties concerning this property on behalf of the vendor.\n3.Every description, measurement, and reference to condition, permitted use, or occupation has been prepared in good faith and is believed accurate at the time of preparation. However, prospective buyers and tenants are advised to verify all such details independently through their own inspection or enquiries rather than relying on this brochure alone.\n4.The Agent provides no warranty or covenant relating to the property. While familiar with its general appearance and layout, the Agent makes no claim to expertise regarding title or planning matters, and responsibility for confirming the sufficiency of such documentation rests entirely with the purchaser.\n5.Confirmation of service availability whether for current or intended use is the responsibility of the purchaser. The Agent offers no guarantees or representations on this matter.\n6.Boundaries, fences, hedges, walls, and ditches are not defined by either the vendor or the Agent, including any determination of party-structure status.\n7.Should any conflict arise between the information in this brochure and the formal contract of sale, the contract of sale will take precedence.\n8.References to \"Vendor\" and \"Purchaser\" throughout this brochure should be read as including \"Lessor\" and \"Lessee,\" or \"Landlord\" and \"Tenant,\" wherever the context applies.\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
